 "remarks": "Beautifully Updated SoNo Studio in the Heart of Downtown South Norwalk! Enjoy the best of urban living in this charming condo ideally situated in the vibrant heart of SoNo! Featuring hardwood floors throughout, recessed lighting, and an updated kitchen with granite countertops and stainless steel appliances, this inviting space offers both style and functionality. The updated bathroom, convenient in-unit washer/dryer hookup, and spacious storage closet add to the home's appeal. Just moments from the Metro-North train station, waterfront, parks, shopping, fabulous restaurants, and the Maritime Aquarium, this location offers the perfect blend of convenience and lifestyle. Whether you're looking for a place to call home or a weekend retreat, this SoNo gem is a wonderful opportunity to enjoy everything downtown South Norwalk has to offer! One parking space available for $90 per month. Washer/Dryer hook up in the unit.",
